{"availability":"available","full":"Yeabtsega-Tesfaye/Personal-Website","name":"Personal-Website","description":"Embark on a journey through the digital realm with my inaugural web project, crafted with the synergy of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. This repository encapsulates the foundational steps of my web development odyssey, showcasing my early explorations in crafting interactive and visually appealing web experiences.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":15,"forks":1,"created":"2024-11-03T00:06:30Z","updated":"2026-08-23T11:46:12Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["css","frontend","javascript","personal-website","portfolio","responsive-design","web-development","woldia"],"demo":"https://yeab-tsega.netlify.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:13.823Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:13.823Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:13.823Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:13.823Z","stars":15,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A handcrafted, zero-dependency portfolio built from scratch with vanilla HTML, CSS, and JavaScript — no frameworks, no build tools, no shortcuts. 7,000 lines of deliberate front-end engineering.","This portfolio is not a template or a cloned starter. It is a ground-up frontend project built to serve two purposes simultaneously: to function as a professional introduction for potential clients and employers, and to serve as a serious technical exercise in what is achievable without a JavaScript framework or build pipeline.","The site encompasses a multi-section single-page layout with a custom terminal welcome sequence, physics-inspired magnetic button interactions, a real-time Canvas-based code rain background, an animated skills marquee with interactive popups, a structured projects/blog section, and a complete CSS design system defined through custom properties."],"features":["A fully scripted terminal simulation runs before the main site loads. Lines of mock shell output are typed character-by-character using a sequenced queue, with a blinking cursor, realistic timing delays, and a \"Skip…","The hero CTA buttons implement a magnetic attraction effect: mousemove events calculate the cursor's offset from the button's center, and the button translates toward the cursor using CSS transform. On mouseleave, the…","A element sits as a fixed background layer. A JavaScript engine renders a Matrix-inspired falling-character effect using the Canvas 2D API — managing column positions, character sets, random speeds, fade trails, and…","Technology skills are rendered in two infinitely looping rows (scrolling in opposite directions) using CSS animation and translateX. Each skill chip is clickable and triggers a centered popup card with skill metadata:…","UI interactions (hover, click, navigation) optionally trigger short audio cues. A toggle control persists the user's sound preference and shows an animated equalizer wave when active — a small but considered detail."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yeabtsega-Tesfaye/Personal-Website/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1eb68b186334903957fb23a0bf70ea74e7782e09f27a3f7be612f0fe98147bfb","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:13.921Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:13.921Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A handcrafted, zero-dependency portfolio built from scratch with vanilla HTML, CSS, and JavaScript — no frameworks, no build tools, no shortcuts. 7,000 lines of deliberate front-end engineering.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yeabtsega-Tesfaye/Personal-Website/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1eb68b186334903957fb23a0bf70ea74e7782e09f27a3f7be612f0fe98147bfb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yeabtsega-Tesfaye/Personal-Website/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:13.921Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-23T11:46:12Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"h